          "study_tip": ""
        },
        {
          "index": 12,
          "title": "Question: buffalo population interpretation",
          "html": "<div class=\"cm-question-workspace\"><div class=\"cm-question-stem\"><div class=\"cm-strategy-chip\"><span class=\"cm-strategy-chip-label\">Strategy</span><p>Difference quotient over an interval → average rate of change.</p></div><div class=\"cm-slide-role cm-slide-role--question\"><span class=\"cm-slide-role-label\">Question Practice</span><strong>Try it first</strong><p>Pause and solve before revealing the worked solution.</p></div><p>Buffalo population \\(b(t)\\), \\(t\\) = years since 1800. What does \\(\\dfrac{b(50)-b(0)}{50-0}\\) represent?</p></div><div class=\"cm-question-interact\"><div class=\"cm-mcq-interactive\" data-cm-mcq data-cm-correct=\"B\"><p class=\"cm-mcq-prompt\">Choose your answer</p><div class=\"cm-mcq-grid\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"A\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">A</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">The population in year 1850</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"B\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">B</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">The average rate of change of population from 1800 to 1850</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"C\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">C</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">The instantaneous rate in 1800</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"D\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">D</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">The total change in population in 50 years only at year 50</span></button></div><div class=\"cm-mcq-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-check\" data-cm-check-mcq disabled>Check answer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-skip\" data-cm-go-answer>View worked solution →</button></div></div></div></div>",
          "kind": "question",
          "group": "practice",
          "section": "1.1",
          "study_tip": "",
          "answer_index": 13,
          "correct_choice": "B"
        },
        {
          "index": 13,
          "title": "Answer: buffalo population",
          "html": "<div class=\"cm-slide-role cm-slide-role--answer\"><span class=\"cm-slide-role-label\">Answer Review</span><strong>Check and correct</strong><p>Compare your work with the final answer and fix any missed step.</p></div><p><strong>Correct Answer: B</strong></p><div class=\"cm-try-banner\" data-cm-try-banner><div class=\"cm-try-banner-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</div><div class=\"cm-try-banner-copy\"><strong>Your turn</strong><span>Work it out on paper first — reveal when you're ready.</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-reveal-btn\" data-cm-reveal-solution>Show solution</button></div><p><strong>Solution:</strong></p><div class=\"cm-solution-panel cm-is-collapsed\" data-cm-solution-panel><p>\\(\\dfrac{b(50)-b(0)}{50-0}\\) is the <strong>average rate of change</strong> of buffalo population from \\(t=0\\) to \\(t=50\\) (years 1800–1850).</p></div>",
