          "kind": "section",
          "group": "divider",
          "section": "1.2",
          "study_tip": ""
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "title": "Question: best interpretation of a limit",
          "html": "<div class=\"cm-question-workspace\"><div class=\"cm-question-stem\"><div class=\"cm-strategy-chip\"><span class=\"cm-strategy-chip-label\">Strategy</span><p>Limits describe approaching behavior, not necessarily the function value at the point.</p></div><div class=\"cm-slide-role cm-slide-role--question\"><span class=\"cm-slide-role-label\">Question Practice</span><strong>Try it first</strong><p>Pause and solve before revealing the worked solution.</p></div><p>Which is the best interpretation of \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 4} f(x)=8\\)?</p></div><div class=\"cm-question-interact\"><div class=\"cm-mcq-interactive\" data-cm-mcq data-cm-correct=\"C\"><p class=\"cm-mcq-prompt\">Choose your answer</p><div class=\"cm-mcq-grid\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"A\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">A</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">The value of \\(f\\) at \\(x=4\\) is 8</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"B\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">B</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">The value of \\(f\\) at \\(x=8\\) is 4</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"C\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">C</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">As \\(x\\) approaches 4, the values of \\(f(x)\\) approach 8</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"D\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">D</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">As \\(x\\) approaches 8, the values of \\(f(x)\\) approach 4</span></button></div><div class=\"cm-mcq-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-check\" data-cm-check-mcq disabled>Check answer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-skip\" data-cm-go-answer>View worked solution →</button></div></div></div></div>",
