        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "title": "Question: which statement is true?",
          "html": "<div class=\"cm-question-workspace\"><div class=\"cm-question-stem\"><div class=\"cm-strategy-chip\"><span class=\"cm-strategy-chip-label\">Strategy</span><p>Mismatched one-sided limits ⇒ two-sided limit does not exist.</p></div><div class=\"cm-slide-role cm-slide-role--question\"><span class=\"cm-slide-role-label\">Question Practice</span><strong>Try it first</strong><p>Pause and solve before revealing the worked solution.</p></div><p>The graph of \\(f\\) has a jump at \\(x=b\\) with left limit 3 and right limit 5. Which is true?</p></div><div class=\"cm-question-interact\"><div class=\"cm-mcq-interactive\" data-cm-mcq data-cm-correct=\"C\"><p class=\"cm-mcq-prompt\">Choose your answer</p><div class=\"cm-mcq-grid\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"A\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">A</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">\\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to b} f(x)=4\\)</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"B\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">B</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">\\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to b} f(x)=5\\)</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"C\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">C</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">\\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to b} f(x)\\) does not exist</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-choice\" data-choice=\"D\"><span class=\"cm-mcq-letter\">D</span><span class=\"cm-mcq-text\">\\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to b} f(x)=3\\)</span></button></div><div class=\"cm-mcq-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-check\" data-cm-check-mcq disabled>Check answer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cm-mcq-skip\" data-cm-go-answer>View worked solution →</button></div></div></div></div>",
